  "description": "Our new FLOW models replace what we used to call TRL models. With the growing trend of dirt riders taking their trail riding to concrete and wood transitions too, we updated the bike accordingly. With stable geometry, chain-stay mounted brakes, longer top tubes (21” and 21.25”), longer cranks and wider bars, these bikes are perfect for larger riders and equally at home going fast in the woods or a concrete bowl. Longer Tech grips with flanges and our alloy Trail pedals work perfectly for all conditions, as do the semi-knobby 2.4 OEM tires which work great on all surfaces including dirt. If you’re looking to go fast and blast, look no further and go with the FLOW.",
